Observed enplaned freight pounds over {F887.period} order US airports with recorded enplanements. Cargo-heavy is read here as highest freight pounds, not as a cargo-share cutoff and not as FAA landed weight. The score is a calculated minmax scaling of that freight inside the set; it restates the same order. This is not the multi-factor investment screen and not a valuation, so it carries no scenario flag, gate, or concentration flag.

