DFW, Dallas Fort Worth International Airport, is the next airport, at {F1081} (score {F2054}).

Equal freight, with equal scores, appears at PIE ({F1633}, score {F2717}) and at PGD ({F1623}, score {F2718}). The rank operator still sequences equal values rather than assigning a shared rank. Freight totals in the leading list are distinct from each other.

The departure ratio is all departures, including cargo configurations, divided by passenger departures on passenger, combi, and seaplane aircraft. Inputs are observed; each ratio is calculated. The T12 level uses {F3538.period} and is a ratio of sums, not an average across months. The monthly table is the trend of that ratio. No fitted slope of the ratio itself is available. Slopes further down describe both departure series and include seasonality.

